2. PROPRIETARY CORE ENGINE & PLATFORM
================================================================================
The core memory engine, backend server, and synchronization protocols are
proprietary software owned by Digital Forge Studios Inc., including but not limited to:
- Thermodynamic Memory Engine (`sulcus-core`)
- High-Performance Native Runtime & Client Binary (`sulcus`)
- Multi-Agent Enterprise Sync & Coordination Server (`sulcus-server`)
- WebAssembly Core Modules (`sulcus-wasm`)
- Autonomous SIU Curation, Neural Classifiers, and Reactive Triggers

